[0.448, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.041, "o", "probing http://localhost:8001 to detect the identity provider…\r\n"]
[0.014, "o", "detected identity provider: localhost\r\nthis domain answers 401 instead of redirecting, so login starts at /oauth2/start\r\n  and treat_401_as_expired was turned on to match\r\n  session cookie family set to \"_oauth2_proxy\" (the default is the AWS load balancer's)\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "added domain \"grafana\" to /tmp/albauth-demo.q9St/home/.albauth.toml\r\n\r\nNext:\r\n  albauth auth login grafana\r\n\r\nThis domain is read-only. To let the model write to it, re-add it with\r\n--allow-method GET --allow-method POST (and so on), or edit allow_methods.\r\n"]
[2.508, "o", "\u001b[2m# Log in once. Normally 'albauth auth login grafana' opens a browser; here dex signs in headlessly.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.015, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m h"]
